# Faunsbane Troll: "Sacrifice an Aura attached to this creature". Turn 1: the Troll enters with its Monster Role and Holy Strength
# (+1/+2) is put on it too (6/7 with the Role). Turn 3: Unholy Strength is put on Bot1's Memnite. An Aura
# attached to the Memnite is no legal sacrifice for the cost (CR 701.21a), and the Troll chooses between its two Auras: sacrificing
# Holy Strength leaves the Monster Role, so the Troll is a 5/5 with trample after the fight with Bot2's Memnite, which is exiled.

